    {
      "id": 229334,
      "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-10T16:28:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ow ow ow</p>\n<p><br>\nI have tried this several times and its a no go each time. Sometimes I get somewhat stable, but then she proceeds to play 5+ Clues in one turn. In addition to trying to deal with all the clues themselves, she keeps playing until one of her nasty one shots or another Diversion comes into play. I can't seem to keep up with all of that as well as the retaliation damage.</p>\n<p>Best I have managed so far is turn 2 flip along with a Fueled Freeze and a Ball Lightning to keep things under somewhat control and managed to get her to 18hp. She was just pumping out too much damage with all the Diversions and Clues though.</p>\n<p>~Komori</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:04:03.338Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
