    {
      "id": 229335,
      "name": "bolnerap",
      "username": "bolnerap",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-11T01:09:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Beat her on the third try after two runs where I (first) got run off the board by an insane chain of Diversions with damage boosts and (second) had nearly the entire environment deck out in three rounds.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Key to victory: Three clues and only three clues on turn 1;&nbsp;only Misplaced Memo survived her flip. Also, 2x&nbsp;Into the Stratosphere guaranteed that two of her remaining three turns would be one card and out by recycling Diversions. Other than that, flipping her quickly and preventing piles of clues meant that I kept my setup, so AZ and Wraith kept hitting for 5+ per turn, Bunker hit for 3 per turn, and Tempest dropped a Lightning Slash on the turn he didn't have ITS.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:04:03.420Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
