      "created_at": "2019-12-11T02:30:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, Into the Stratosphere and Infra-Red were MVPs for me. Ended up being very luck based at the end; ended up having Wraith and Bunker sacrifice themselves to get Miss Information down to four with a Trial by Fire in play; lucked out and had Anubis make an appearance to finish her off. Never playing this one again.</p>",
