      "cooked": "<p><span><span><span>This one was brutal.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Ended with only 1 health on one hero when I took her down the game only lasted 4 turns.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Got my “Fine” after 7 attempts not including the countless time I reset until 3 clues were showing at startup.&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Ultimately, I used tempest’s power to get him a big hand and hit her with lightning ball and slashes 3 turns till he fell with everyone else dealing as much damage as they could each turn.&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Never thought I would find a use for freedom six tempest’s power let alone it saving the game.</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><span>I don’t have any real hints for this one except get super lucky.&nbsp; You might be able to win with the old woman pumping up AZ or a hand full of stratosphere but in the end, it will come down to super luck to win this one.</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><span>(P.S. got to meet Christipher as PAX unplugged this last weekend,&nbsp; soooo cool.)</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
